NOTE ON DUAL LICENSING

This repository is dual-licensed:

  * Source code (everything outside `data/`, including the parsing and
    expansion notebooks under `src/` such as `s01_parse_fiebdc.ipynb`,
    `s02_split_chapters.ipynb`, ..., `s08_Llamaindex_Doc_Creation.ipynb`,
    `Generate_OEB_dataset.ipynb`, and the supporting modules under
    `src/utils/`) is licensed under the MIT License above.

  * Data files under `data/` are licensed separately. See the
    accompanying LICENSE-DATA file, which distinguishes three tiers:

      - `data/raw/`           — verbatim redistribution of ADIF's BC3
                                catalog (UTF-8 transcoded). Terms are
                                those set by ADIF, not by this project.
      - `data/intermediate/`  — derived JSON dumps; CC-BY-4.0.
      - `data/processed/`     — final query/document pairs; CC-BY-4.0.

The BC3/FIEBDC format specification is maintained by FIEBDC
(https://www.fiebdc.es) and is referenced descriptively in this work;
no FIEBDC materials are redistributed here.
